 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Textual cohesion through deictic elements and pro-forms",
     "texto": [
      "In B2.2 academic and legislative texts, mechanical repetitions are avoided by chaining ideas through precise pro-forms:",
      "1. **Demonstrative dies**: summarises a complete complex proposition already formulated: **Die Rohstoffpreise explodierten. Dies führte zu einer Schieflage** (raw material prices shot up; this led to an imbalance).",
      "2. **Adverbial pronoun dadurch**: links a fact with its direct consequence: **Der Konzern rationalisierte die Abläufe; dadurch stieg die Produktivität** (the group streamlined its processes; as a result productivity rose).",
      "3. **hierfür / dazu**: pick up formal goals or objects: **Wir benötigen zusätzliche Mittel. Hierfür wurde ein Fond geschaffen** (we need additional funds; a fund was set up for this purpose)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Reference element",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Anaphoric function",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Textual example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
